WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.700
Drive Impact creates the corner Crush state.

2
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:03.800
Both heavy-punch target inputs continue the wall juggle.

3
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.100
The light rushing kicks lift Luke for the final special.

4
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:06.900
The medium rising-kick special finishes the corner conversion.
